# The build context is the REPO ROOT (docker build -f amd/system1/service/Dockerfile .), so BuildKit reads
# this file through its sibling `Dockerfile.dockerignore` (a symlink to it). Allowlist: send only what the
# image COPYs, never checkpoints, venvs or data (gigabytes).
*
!amd/system1/triage/
!amd/system1/service/
amd/system1/service/tests/
amd/system1/service/README.md
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
